      "writtenOn": "2023-02-28T20:50:03Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This is indeed added manually.\n`Fixture` is in e2e_tests and only used in e2e_tests, which are only enabled for x86_64. See https://crosvm.dev/book/testing.html\nSince it\u0027s not supported, we need to add it to `workspace_excludes` to avoid having an Android.bp file generated for it.",
      "parentUuid": "6993eb27_162fb8ef",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 29,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 29,
        "endChar": 14
      },
      "revId": "4a42fb378994029f5772527bed3629e24a583e3f",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "5daeb422_1e7d2ed7",
        "filename": "cargo_embargo.json",
        "patchSetId": 1
      },
      "lineNbr": 29,
      "author": {
        "id": 1644679
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-02-28T21:01:13Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Thanks! So it failed to build after the merge and you noticed it was in e2e_tests and remembered it should be added here? Basically, how would I know to do this in the future if I didn\u0027t ask these questions?",
      "parentUuid": "8353e377_3718caf0",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 29,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 29,
        "endChar": 14
      },
      "revId": "4a42fb378994029f5772527bed3629e24a583e3f",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "8b735986_02fc5c9a",
        "filename": "cargo_embargo.json",
        "patchSetId": 1
