      "writtenOn": "2023-02-28T21:16:08Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "That is indeed what happened - failed to build, and saw fixture now has a Cargo.toml which led to me adding it to skip since I know e2e_tests are only enabled on x86_64.\n\nWe shouldn\u0027t want to enable e2e_tests until they\u0027re supported for more architectures -\u003e disable them right now.",
      "parentUuid": "5daeb422_1e7d2ed7",
      "range": {
